---

<section id="lab" class="py-24 px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 border-b-3 border-[#0A0F14] bg-[#F3F1EB] relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    
    <!-- Chapter Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-[#DCC5FF] text-[#0A0F14] font-mono-tech text-xs font-bold mb-8 brutal-border">
      [07] EXPERIMENTAL LAB & PLAYGROUND
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-12 gap-6">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-4xl sm:text-6xl uppercase tracking-tight">
          THINGS I BUILD TO LEARN
        </h2>
        <p class="font-sans text-base text-[#0A0F14]/80 mt-2 max-w-2xl">
          The Lab is my sandbox for testing emerging web specs, AI workflow tools, hardware integrations, and rapid micro-experiments.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Lab Experiments Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 font-mono-tech">
      
      <div class="p-6 bg-white brutal-border-thick brutal-shadow-hover space-y-4">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-bold text-[#FF6B22]">
          <span>AI / LLM TOOLS</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-[#FF6B22] text-white">EXPERIMENTAL</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl uppercase">Terminal Autonomous Agent</h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#0A0F14]/70 leading-relaxed">
          Exploring low-level Zsh and CLI integrations driven by natural language intent parsing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-white brutal-border-thick brutal-shadow-hover space-y-4">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-bold text-[#4A9EFF]">
          <span>WEB PROTOCOLS</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-[#4A9EFF] text-white">PROTOTYPE</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl uppercase">Static Content Loader</h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#0A0F14]/70 leading-relaxed">
          A custom Astro 5 loader pattern for syncing distributed markdown archives with zero bundle bloat.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-white brutal-border-thick brutal-shadow-hover space-y-4">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-bold text-[#54D69A]">
          <span>HARDWARE / IOT</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-[#54D69A] text-[#0A0F14]">IDEATION</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl uppercase">Telemetry Sensor Hub</h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#0A0F14]/70 leading-relaxed">
          Prototype dashboard receiving WebSocket signals from low-power microcontroller nodes.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
